Dataset Overview - 

Dataset Source - Kaggle
Dataset Link - https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/nisargpatel344/bank-marketing-dataset-for-term-deposit-prediction
Total Records: 100,000 individual banking clients
Features: 45 columns
Target Variable: TermDepositSubscribed (1 = subscribed, 0 = not subscribed)

The dataset contains 100,000 customer records, each representing an individual banking client along with their demographic, financial, behavioral, and marketing interaction attributes.
The dataset consists of 45 columns, including the target variable TermDepositSubscribed, which indicates whether a customer subscribed to a term-deposit offer (1 = yes, 0 = no).

Each row provides:
Personal and demographic information
Income, credit score, and wealth indicators
Product ownership and account relationship details
Digital activity and transactional behavior
Past and current marketing engagement
A binary outcome variable for predictive modeling
